# Destructive ops (honesty labels)

| Control | Label |
|---------|-------|
| `git push` | Enforced (best-effort) via hooks denylist; `/push` session override |
| `git push --force` | Enforced (best-effort); no override |
| Production deploys | Instructed |
| Committing `.env` / secrets | Instructed + never do it |

Hooks are **fail-open** on parse error. Prefer PRs; never force-push or delete target repos.
